ne formatting as standard. Per-release pricing starts at $149.\n</div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Angles</p>\n      <h2>What actually gets picked up in travel & hospitality</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Most releases in this sector fail for the same reason: they describe the organisation instead of the news. These are the angles that travel.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g-3\" data-stagger>\n      <article class=\"card spotlight\">\n        <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.4 2 5 13.4h5.4L9.8 22 18.5 10.5h-5.6z\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Openings and route news</h3><p>Hotel, restaurant and airline route launches with dates and pricing.</p>\n      </article><article class=\"card spotlight\">\n        <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.4 2 5 13.4h5.4L9.8 22 18.5 10.5h-5.6z\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Awards and rankings</h3><p>Recognitions that a trade desk would actually report.</p>\n      </article><article class=\"card spotlight\">\n        <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.4 2 5 13.4h5.4L9.8 22 18.5 10.5h-5.6z\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Destination campaigns</h3><p>Seasonal programmes, events and tourism board initiatives.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"m