none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Executive hires</span></li></ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack prose\" style=\"--flow:1rem\" data-reveal=\"right\">\n        <h3 class=\"mt-0\">How this route is built</h3>\n        <p>Our travel & hospitality route combines national and international newswires with sector trade press, regional desks in the metros that matter to you, and the AI answer engines that handle industry questions. You choose the tier; we handle the routing.</p>\n        <p>Reviews are handled by editors who work this beat, which matters most when a claim needs qualifying or a number needs a source.</p>\n        <p><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"distribution.html\">How distribution routing works <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section section-tight\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    <div class=\"panel panel-glass\" style=\"padding:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,2.25rem);border-radius:var(--r-xl)\" data-reveal>\n      \n<div class=\"callout callout-takeaways\" data-reveal>\n  <strong>Key takeaways</strong>\n  <ul><li>Median first pickup for travel & hospitality releases: 38 minutes on priority plans.</li><li>1,250+ sector-relevant outlets, plus AI answer engines on every plan.</li><li>Specialist editorial review — not a generic queue.</li><li>Metro and country-level targeting included at no extra cost.</li></ul>\n</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"split\" style=\"align-items:start\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\" style=\"margin-bottom:0\" data-reveal>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Answers</p>\n        <h2>Travel & Hospitality distribution questions</h2>\n        \n        <p class=\"mt-3 muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Still stuck? <a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"contact.html\">Talk to a specialist <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-list\" data-accordion=\"single\">\n        <div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">When is the best time to send travel news?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Tuesday to Thursday, early morning in the target market. Travel trade desks plan seasonally, so lead times of six to eight weeks outperform last-minute sends.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">Can you distribute to trade press rather than consumers?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Yes, and for most travel businesses the trade route produces better-qualified coverage than consumer lifestyle desks.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">Do you handle multi-market launches?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Yes — coordinated release across regions with localised copy in the relevant language, rather than one English release sent everywhere.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">Are images required?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Not required, but travel pickup rates roughly double when a quality image set is attached.</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Related industries</p>\n      <h2>Other sectors we cover</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g-3\"><a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"technology.html\" data-reveal><h3>Technology</h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">11,400+ tech desks and newsletters in network</p></a><a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"saas.html\" data-reveal><h3>SaaS & B2B Software</h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">3,900+ B2B review sites and analyst blogs in network</p></a><a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"finance.html\" data-reveal><h3>Finance & Banking</h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Terminal and analyst-desk delivery across 41 markets</p></a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"cta-band\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center;display:inline-flex\">Get started</p>\n      <h2 style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Send your next travel & hospitality announcement to the desks that cover it.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede mx-auto\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;max-width:60ch\">Editorial review, sector targeting, monitoring and AI visibility reporting included.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-actions\" style=\"justify-content:center\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-lg\" href=\"submit.html\">Submit a press release</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" h